{"id":"vod_bf_25901","vodId":"25901","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"漂流少年","name_cn":"漂流少年","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-27/a5b59816d8366c1a202ca054d40d2003.jpg"},"summary":"漫长的暑假已然过半的8月16日。聚集在学校里的中学三年级学生·长良一行人突然被卷进从未设想过的事态之中。长良本人自不必说，神秘的转校生·希和瑞穗以及朝风等36名同班同学，都随着学校一起在异次元之中漂流。而且他们在漂流的同时也获得了各种各样的“能力”。有因为获得了超越常人的能力而心 生欢喜，用能力肆意作乱的人，也有作为领导统帅着学生们，拼死寻找回到原本世界方法的人。相互质疑、无法克制的嫉妒心，还有支配欲引发了对立。接二连三发生的难以解决的事件面前，少年少女们突然被扔进了求生生活之中。长良他们究竟能否攻略这个世界，平安回到原本的世界呢……？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"科幻,动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:54:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/piaoliushaonian/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T05:52:07.160Z"}